# Window management
# yabai needs two steps this file cannot do: partially disabling SIP and installing the
# scripting addition, then `yabai --start-service`. Until both happen the binary is
# installed but no window manager is running.
# koekeishiya/formulae is the project's own tap. Upstream development moved to the asmvik
# fork and both taps build the identical 7.1.25 tarball from it, so the official namespace
# is the safer of the two to name. `trusted: true` is not optional: Homebrew refuses to
# load a formula from any third-party tap without it, official or not, so the choice is
# this flag or no brew-installed yabai. Same flag, same reason, as the charmbracelet
# formula above.
tap "koekeishiya/formulae"
brew "koekeishiya/formulae/yabai", trusted: true
